│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ lpt_local_search_refinement                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ The greedy LPT packing in `balanced_packing` is fast but leaves a residual load spread    │
│                          │ between the heaviest and lightest packs, which caps both the GPU-load balancedness (0.66) │
│                          │ and the per-expert balancedness (0.25). Since the algorithm runtime is currently          │
│                          │ negligible (times_algorithm ≈ 0.01) while speed_score is dominated by inference time      │
│                          │ (i.e., by the quality of the placement), we can afford a cheap local-search refinement    │
│                          │ phase. After the greedy assignment, for each layer we repeatedly identify the heaviest    │
│                          │ and lightest packs and swap the largest-weight item in the heavy pack with the            │
│                          │ smallest-weight item in the light pack whenever the swap provably reduces the spread      │
│                          │ (weight difference exceeds half the spread). This preserves all invariants (each pack     │
│                          │ still holds exactly n/m items, ranks remain a valid permutation) so downstream code is    │
│                          │ unaffected, while monotonically shrinking the max–min pack load gap — directly improving  │
│                          │ GPU load balance and, through it, inference-time balance. The refinement converges        │
│                          │ quickly (a few swaps per layer) so the added runtime is negligible.                       │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0151                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ z-ai/glm-5.3                                                                              │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ reasoning                │ {'effort': 'low'}                                                                         │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 36; deleted: 0; modified: 0;                                                       │
