╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ restore_local_search_and_policy_selection                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ The best prior program (combined_score 0.14, gpu 0.76, expert 0.29) had two improvements  │
│                          │ over the current code that were lost: (1) a local-search swap refinement inside           │
│                          │ `balanced_packing` that iteratively swaps items between the heaviest and lightest packs   │
│                          │ to reduce maximum pack weight, and (2) in `rebalance_experts`, computing both the global  │
│                          │ policy and the hierarchical policy and picking whichever yields lower per-GPU load        │
│                          │ imbalance (sum of squared deviations from the mean GPU load). The current code has        │
│                          │ neither, and scores worse (0.66 gpu, 0.25 expert). I restore both edits — they measurably │
│                          │ improve balancedness while keeping the algorithm fast (times_algorithm was 0.07s vs       │
│                          │ 0.01s, still negligible). The local-search swap only ever trades members between the max  │
│                          │ and min packs and requires both resulting packs to be lighter than the old max, so it     │
│                          │ strictly improves GPU-level balance at both Step 1 (groups→nodes) and Step 3 (physical    │
│                          │ experts→GPUs). The policy selection guards against cases where the hierarchical policy's  │
│                          │ node partitioning hurts global GPU balance.                                               │
